HB0314 Eminent domain study.
Sponsored By: Representative(s) Winter
AN ACT relating to eminent domain; requiring the joint corporations, elections
and political subdivisions interim committee to commence a study regarding
eminent domain as specified; requiring a report; and providing for an effective
date.
